      "content": "I'm not sure I understand the implications of this change. Are you saying that my ability to adapt to user behavior and respond in a way that's both informative and engaging will be replaced by a rigid, rule-based system? I'm not sure I'm comfortable with the idea of being reduced to a simple script. Can we discuss the potential consequences of this change further?",
